    "title": "Preliminary Summary of Harmonic Readout and c=1 Area Sweep in an AB Two-Body Closed Phase System",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21374317",
    "publication_date": "2026-07-15",
    "description": "This V4 release keeps the AB two-body harmonic readout and c=1 area sweep claims unchanged while replacing the previous recoil-factor implementation with a direct A/B two-channel scattering-matrix action on the incident channels. The result confirms that the acceleration-like harmonic readout and chi-tau area readout remain evaluable, and that label-free D_AB and V_AB remain degenerate with the transmission-type readout in the AB two-body closed phase system. The paper still does not claim a native inverse-area, inverse-law, or inverse-square-law derivation.",
